1. Two Sum — LeetCode #1

Pattern: HashMap

Question: Given an array and a target, return the indices of two numbers whose sum equals the target.

class Solution {
    public int[] twoSum(int[] nums, int target) {

        HashMap<Integer, Integer> map = new HashMap<>();

        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {

            int need = target - nums[i];

            if (map.containsKey(need)) {
                return new int[]{map.get(need), i};
            }

            map.put(nums[i], i);
        }

        return new int[]{};
    }
}

Example:

nums = [2,7,11,15]
target = 9

Output = [0,1]

Idea:
need = target - current number

If need already exists in HashMap → answer found.

Time: O(n)
Space: O(n)

2. Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock — LeetCode #121

Pattern: One-pass / Greedy

Question: Find the maximum profit from buying on one day and selling on a later day.

class Solution {
    public int maxProfit(int[] prices) {

        int minPrice = prices[0];
        int maxProfit = 0;

        for (int i = 1; i < prices.length; i++) {

            if (prices[i] < minPrice) {
                minPrice = prices[i];
            }

            int profit = prices[i] - minPrice;

            if (profit > maxProfit) {
                maxProfit = profit;
            }
        }

        return maxProfit;
    }
}

Example:

prices = [7,1,5,3,6,4]

Output = 5

Buy at 1, sell at 6.

Core idea:

Keep the minimum price seen so far.
Calculate today's profit.
Keep the maximum profit.

Time: O(n)
Space: O(1)

3. Valid Parentheses — LeetCode #20

Pattern: Stack

Question: Check whether brackets are correctly opened and closed.

class Solution {
    public boolean isValid(String s) {

        Stack<Character> stack = new Stack<>();

        for (char ch : s.toCharArray()) {

            if (ch == '(' || ch == '{' || ch == '[') {
                stack.push(ch);
            }
            else {

                if (stack.isEmpty()) {
                    return false;
                }

                char top = stack.pop();

                if (ch == ')' && top != '(') {
                    return false;
                }

                if (ch == '}' && top != '{') {
                    return false;
                }

                if (ch == ']' && top != '[') {
                    return false;
                }
            }
        }

        return stack.isEmpty();
    }
}
